   "message": "you are effectively our Milady lighthouse operator right now, and one thing I'd like to see from lighthouse operators is either\n\n- charting the path of what a new member to the network looks like (this helps explain the network to outsiders, through the eyes of the beginner)\n- reporting on any significant \"events\" that saturate your network. Like a lot of things pop up in the attention stream but every now and then something captures the attention of almost everyone in that particular network, and we can use these events to demarcate the \"boundaries\"",
